From 7fd128440553b14e86cc4182e04fcecc94071325 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zed-patches <zed-patches@localhost>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 16:02:11 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] agent_ui: the default pin is Claude Agent (Plus)'s, beside
 the check and the star
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Zeo next proposal §6.57 (ask 81), correcting §6.48. The pin was always
meant for Claude Agent (Plus) only (operator, 2026-11-17). Plus's mode,
model and effort come through the config-options picker, whose hover slot
held only the favourite star: ListItem::end_slot_on_hover replaces the
resting slot, so on hover the pin and the check vanished, and at rest the
three icons were 12, 16 and 14 px.

- language_model_selector::menu_row_markers lays out the end of a menu row
  once -- the pin, the check, and on hover the star -- with one padding
  and one size (IconSize::Small) for all three. The config-options picker
  uses it for both slots, so hovering adds the star and keeps the others.
- In the config-options picker the pin shows only when the agent is
  Claude Agent (Plus) (agent id `claude-agent-acp-plus`,
  ZEO_PLUS_AGENT_ID). The Shift-click gesture and its hint are unchanged
  for every agent.
- The pin is removed from the native agent's menus, where §6.48 (0010)
  put it: the model list (ModelSelectorListItem loses is_default), the
  mode menu and the effort menu. AgentModelSelector::default_model_id is
  left in place, now unread by the UI.

A separate patch rather than an amendment of 0010: the files it touches
were rewritten by later patches (0059, 0073, 0135), so the change only
applies on top of them.

Test config_options::tests::only_claude_agent_plus_shows_the_default_pin.
Proved on Xvfb with a stub under Plus's id (docs/assets/zeo-wave3-fixes-2026-11-21/
in the hub: pin and check at rest, pin, check and star on hover).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
